  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nGiven: X : 66 :: 9 : Y\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) X = 9, Y = 81 → 9 : 66 :: 9 : 81\n\n__9²__ + 2 = 66\n\n81 + 2 = 66\n\n83 ≠ 66 (LHS ≠ RHS);\n\n__92__ + 2 = 81\n\n81 + 2 = 81\n\n83 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) X = 8, Y = 83 → 8 : 66 :: 9 : 83\n\n__8²__ + 2 = 64\n\n64 + 2 = 64\n\n64 = 64 (LHS = RHS);\n\n__9²__ + 2 = 83\n\n__81 + 2__ = 83\n\n83 = 83 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) X = 8, Y = 81 → 8 : 66 :: 9 : 81\n\n__82__ + 2 = 66\n\n64 + 2 = 66\n\n66 = 66 (LHS = RHS);\n\n__92__ + 2 = 81\n\n81 + 2 = 81\n\n83 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) X = 7, Y = 80 → 7 : 66 :: 9 : 80\n\n__72__ + 2 = 66\n\n49 + 2 = 66\n\n51 ≠ 66 (LHS ≠ RHS);\n\n__92__ + 2 = 80\n\n81 + 2 = 80\n\n83 ≠ 80 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
